    "- We partition the dataset into an **80% training set (68 samples)** and a **20% test set (17 samples)**.\n",
    "- We set `random_state=42` to guarantee complete reproducibility.\n",
    "- We apply `stratify=y` to preserve proportional class balance across both splits, preventing class starvation in small categories like Sports."
