    "---\n",
    "## 4. Vocabulary Construction (Strictly from Training Set)\n",
    "\n",
    "The vocabulary defines the feature space $\\mathcal{V}$ for our Bag-of-Words representation.\n",
    "- Every unique token present in `train_df['tokens']` is indexed: $w \\mapsto i \\in \\{0, 1, \\dots, |\\mathcal{V}|-1\\}$.\n",
    "- We sort the vocabulary lexicographically to ensure a deterministic feature indexing.\n",
    "- **Out-of-Vocabulary (OOV) tokens:** Any novel word appearing in the test set that was never seen during training is ignored during inference. This simulates a real-world deployment scenario without data leakage."
   ]
  },
