    "---\n",
    "## 5. Bag of Words (BoW) Representation\n",
    "\n",
    "In the Bag-of-Words representation:\n",
    "- Each document $d$ is mapped to a vector $\\mathbf{x} = [x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_{|\\mathcal{V}|}]^T \\in \\mathbb{R}^{|\\mathcal{V}|}$.\n",
    "- $x_j$ represents the frequency (count) of vocabulary word $w_j$ in document $d$.\n",
    "- We implement this manually in `transform_bow()` without using `CountVectorizer`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "e06863ad",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-17T05:37:09.689694Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-17T05:37:09.689097Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-17T05:37:09.699325Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-17T05:37:09.698074Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "X_train matrix shape: (68, 345) (documents x vocabulary)\n",
      "X_test matrix shape:  (17, 345) (documents x vocabulary)\n",
      "X_train matrix sparsity: 97.75%\n",
      "Average active words per training document: 7.79\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def transform_bow(tokens_series, vocabulary: dict) -> np.ndarray:\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Converts a series/list of token lists into a 2D Bag-of-Words count matrix.\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Parameters:\n",
    "        tokens_series: Iterable of token lists.\n",
    "        vocabulary (dict): Mapping from word string to column index.\n",
    "        \n",
    "    Returns:\n",
    "        np.ndarray: 2D integer count matrix of shape (n_samples, |V|).\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    n_samples = len(tokens_series)\n",
    "    n_features = len(vocabulary)\n",
    "    bow_matrix = np.zeros((n_samples, n_features), dtype=np.int32)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for row_idx, tokens in enumerate(tokens_series):\n",
    "        for token in tokens:\n",
    "            if token in vocabulary:\n",
    "                col_idx = vocabulary[token]\n",
    "                bow_matrix[row_idx, col_idx] += 1\n",
    "                \n",
    "    return bow_matrix\n",
    "\n",
    "# Construct Bag-of-Words matrices for Train and Test sets\n",
    "X_train = transform_bow(train_df['tokens'], vocab)\n",
    "X_test = transform_bow(test_df['tokens'], vocab)\n",
    "\n",
    "y_train = train_df['label'].values\n",
    "y_test = test_df['label'].values\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"X_train matrix shape: {X_train.shape} (documents x vocabulary)\")\n",
    "print(f\"X_test matrix shape:  {X_test.shape} (documents x vocabulary)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Check sparsity\n",
    "sparsity = 1.0 - (np.count_nonzero(X_train) / float(X_train.size))\n",
    "print(f\"X_train matrix sparsity: {sparsity * 100:.2f}%\")\n",
    "print(f\"Average active words per training document: {np.mean(np.sum(X_train, axis=1)):.2f}\")"
   ]
  },
